       WERE INACTIVE FOR QUITE A WHILE.        ×E DECIDED TO TRY IMPORTING TO          STAY ACTIVE, AND OF COURSE THAT         DIDN'T GO OVER WELL WITH SOME OF        THE ESTABLISHED IMPORTING GROUPS.       ÔHAT'S WHEN THE PROBLEMS STARTED.       ÂUT, EVEN WITH ALL OF THE HASSLE        WE'RE STILL HERE AND WILL START         RELEASING CRACKS AGAIN.                                                  ÃOOKIE:É DON'T THINK É HAVE A HARD PART        BEING AFFILIATED WITH THE GROUP         É DISTRIBUTE FOR, ÍÉÒÁÇÅ. ÔHE           GROUP TAKES EXCELLENT CARE              TOWARDS THEIR BOARDS, AND AFTER 2       YEARS É DON'T HAVE ANY COMPLAINTS       TO MAKE......                                                            5)ÄO YOU FEEL THAT IF YOU WERE MALE YOU   WOULD GET: MORE RESPECT, LESS RESPECT,  OR GET THE SAME AMOUNT OF RESPECT?                                             ÁCYEE:ÎO DOUBT É WOULD GET MORE RESPECT       IF É WERE MALE. ÆOR THE MOST PART       THE GUYS É DEAL WITH ARE SECURE         ENOUGH TO NOT BE CONCERNED WITH A       GIRL OPERATING IN A "MAN'S              WORLD." ÔHEN THERE ARE A FEW            LITTLE BOYS WHOSE BRAINS ARE            RULED BY THE SAME GLANDS THAT           CAUSE THE ZITTS ON THEIR FACES,         AND THE OLDER NEVER-WERE'S CAN'T        HANDLE IT EITHER. ÁN EXAMPLE WAS        WHEN WE STARTED TRADING WITH            ÉËÁÒÉ+ÔÁÌÅÎÔ. ÅVEN THOUGHT THEY         HAD BEEN TRADING WITH DIFFERENT         GROUPS FOR SOME MONTHS, NO BIG          DEAL WAS MADE WHEN THEY CHANGED         GROUPS. ×HEN WE STARTED TRADING         WITH THEM THE SHIT HIT THE FAN!         ÆORGET THAT WE HAVE Ô×Ï GOOD            FIXERS WHEN SOME GROUPS DON'T           HAVE ÏÎÅ. ÆORGET THAT ÒAINMAN           DOES A GOOD JOB CONTACTING ÅUROS.       "ÏH MY, A GIRL IS RUNNING THAT          GROUP SO THERE HAS TO BE SOME           FUNNY BUSINESS GOING ON!" ÔHESE         BRAVE BOYS WERE AFRAID TO TACKLE        THE GUYS, SO THEY GO AFTER ME.          ÔHAT'S COOL, THEY GOT THEIR      