ÁRITCLE #2:×HY É ÌEFT ÔHE ÅLITE ×ORLD   ×RITTEN ÂY:ÍORTICIAN                    ÒEASON ×HY:ÌOST AND ÆOUND: ÔHE ÃLASSIC             ÔALE OF ÓURIVIAL OF A ÓOUL.             ×E LEFT THIS ARTICLE JUST THE           WAY ÍORTICIAN WROTE IT, WITH            INSULTS LEFT IN, ONLY EDITING           FOR GRAMMAR AND SUCH.                                                  ÄURING THE WEEK OF ÊUNE 17TH, 1990, É CLOSED DOWN MY BOARD, ÔHE ÌAND OF       ÃONFUSION BECAUSE ITS RANKING WAS VERY  LOW AND É HAD FEW USERS WHO CALLED ON   REGULAR BASIS. ÁFTER THE CLOSING OF MY  BOARD É WAS DEBATING ON TO QUIT CALLING OUT ALL TOGETHER AND DROPING ÇENESIS    ÐROJECT. ×HEN É GOT IN TOUCH WITH THE   ÇOBLIN WE DISCUSSED MY LEAVING THE GROUPAND DECIDED IT WAS A BAD IDEA FOR ME TO LEAVE AND THAT HE AND THE REST OF THE   GROUP WOULD LIKE FOR ME TO STAY IN THE  GROUP AND KEEP SUPPLYING ÁÔ&Ô'S AND TO  DECIDE FOR MYSELF TO QUIT CALLING OUT.  ÍY FIRST DECISION WAS TO QUIT CALLING   OUT BECAUSE OF A CERTAIN MISHAP BETWEEN ÂUTCHER, A FRIEND OF HIS (BOTH OF WHOM  É'M FRIENDS WITH NOW), AND MYSELF. ÔHIS LEAD TO A SERIES OF RAGS MADE TOWARD ME BY A HANDFUL OF LAME PEOPLE. ÓINCE É HADNEVER BEEN RAGGED ON BEFORE É HAD NO    IDEA HOW TO MAKE A COMEBACK TOWARDS     THESE RAGS. É THOUGHT É COULD JUST LEAVE ALL THIS BEHIND ME BY QUITTING CALLING OUT. ÁFTER TALKING WITH A FEW OF MY     FRIENDS, THEY GAVE ME THE ENCOURAGEMENT TO CONTINUE CALLING OUT ALTHOUGH É HAD  A LARGE MAJORITY OF MY ACCOUNTS DELETED FROM THE ÂÂÓ'S É CALLED. ÓINCE É WAS    LEAVING FOR ÙARO ÂEACH, ÆLA. IN TWO     DAYS, É DECIDED É WOULD REGAIN ALL MY   OLD ACCOUNTS WHEN É WAS TO RETURN, THREE WEEKS LATER.                                                                     ÐRESENTLY É HAVE BEEN WORKING ON THIS ARITCLE AND WARRING LAMERS SUCH AS:     ÄICKSWEAT (ÄEADSHOT), ÓCAGGS (ÓCRAGGS), AND LAST AND DEFINITELY LEAST, THE ÂÉÇ  ÌÁÍÅÒ WE ALL HATE: ÔÅÍÐÅÓÔÏÕÓ. ×ELL,    THAT'S ALL FOR NOW MORTAL ONES. (ÅÄ     ÎÏÔÅ: ×HILE A TAD OUTDATED, THIS ARTICLE WAS PUT IN ANYWAY. ÔEMPESTOUS HAS LONG BEEN DELETED FROM ÄISINTEGRATION, BUT   THE OTHER TWO ARE STILL HERE.....)                                              ¢¢¢¢¢¢¢¢¢¢¢¢¢¢¢¢¢¢¢¢¢¢¢¢¢¢¢¢¢¢¢¢¢¢¢¢¢¢¢¢¸¸¸¸¸¸¸¸¸¸¸¸¸¸¸¸¸¸¸¸¸¸¸¸¸¸¸¸¸¸¸¸¸¸¸¸¸¸¸¸                                        ÁRTICLE #3:ÆULL OF ÓHIT                 ×RITTEN ÂY:ÃRUMBSUCKER                  ÒEASON ×HY:ÏRIGINALLY A SUB TOPIC ON               ÃHANNEL 0, THIS GEM OF A BAD            TIME HAD TO BE READ BY ALL.                                            ÏK, WELL HOW SHOULD É START THIS? ÔHIS STORY HAD FIRST BROKEN THROUGH ON MY   ÂÂÓ - ÃHANNEL ÚER0. ×E WERE JUST        DISCUSSING STUFF IN THE "ÒEAL ÌIFE" SUB AMD THE SUBJECT WAS: ×ÈÁÔ ÉÓ ÔÈÅ ÍÏÓÔ   ÄÉÓÇÕÓÔÉÎÇ ÔÈÉÎÇ ÔÈÁÔ ÈÁÓ ÅÖÅÒ ÈÁÐÐÅÎÅÄ ÔÏ ÙÏÕ? ÓO É DECIDED TO TELL THE REAL   LIFE STORY OF HOW É SHITTED IN MY PANTS A FEW YEARS AGO. ÁND BY POPULAR DEMAND, ALL OF YOU NOW HAVE THE PRIVELAGE (?)   OF READING THIS WONDERFUL STORY.                                                  ×ELL THIS HAPPENED 2 YEARS AGO (WHEN É WAS 18). ÍY FRIEND AND É WERE COMING   HOME FROM A CONCERT (IT WAS A HARDCORE  SHOW AND THE BANDS WERE ÒAW ÄEAL AND    ÓICK ÏF ÉT ÁLL; FOR THOSE WHO REALLY    CARE). ÁNYWAY WE STOPPED TO HAVE SOME   PIZZA BEFORE WE PROCEEDED WITH OUR      VOYAGE HOME. ÔHE PIZZA WAS ROTTEN AND   THE NIGHT OF HELL HAD ONLY BEGUN. ÏN THE WAY HOME WE TOOK A TRAIN AND ON THIS   TRAIN, É BEGAN EXPERIENCING TERRIBLE    CRAMPS; YOU KNOW, THE ONES THAT SIGNIFY ÄÉÁÒÉÁ. ÁNYWAY, É TRIED MY BEST TO HOLD THE SHIT BUT TO NO AVAIL. ÁS MANY OF YOU KNOW OR FOR THOSE THAT DON'T YET: IF   YOU FIGHT MOTHER NATURE YOU WILL ÌÏÏÓÅ, AND THAT'S EXACTLY WHAT HAPPENED TO ME.                                           É HAD SHIT IN MY PANTS, RIGHT ON THE  FUCKIN' TRAIN! ÌUCKILY THIS WAS A ÓUNDAY NIGHT AND THERE WEREN'T TOO MANY PEOPLE ON THE TRAIN. ÔHE ROTTEN DIARIA WAS    RUNNING DOWN BOTH MY LEGS, AND THERE WAS MORE WHERE THAT CAME FROM. ÔHE DOORS OF THE TRAIN OPENED AND A LADY WITH 2 KIDS